\b 17. Suggested Handoff Note For Customer Teams\b0\par
\par
If you need to hand this to a customer or internal operator, use this short message:\par
\par
"First deploy the application and Azure resources. Second, complete the database initialization. If the customer wants to reuse an existing SQL server, Key Vault, or storage account, confirm that up front because only some of those cases are directly supported by the current deployment inputs."\par
